Preparing for the release is in full swing. The 1.44 version is live:
[list]
[*]Now bays go yellow after 70% of health (instead of 90%) and red after 30% (instead of 40%);
[*]Improved battle performance;
[*]Fixed some bugs that caused crashes;
[*]A lot of small fixes.
[/list]

Preparing for the release is in full swing. The 1.44 version is live:
[list]
[*]Now bays go yellow after 70% of health (instead of 90%) and red after 30% (instead of 40%);
[*]Improved battle performance;
[*]Fixed some bugs that caused crashes;
[*]A lot of small fixes.
[/list]

[h1]New Features[/h1][list][*]New playable ships! Choose a spaceship for your journey through the galaxy – Human, Oaklana and Chax. Each ship is set up for the different play style. New ships unlock by reaching new profile levels;
[*]Two new fully reworked main missions. Adventures in the deep cosmos are waiting for you![/list]
[h1]Important Changes[/h1][list][*]Refactored progression system. Gain space points after every game and unlock new possibilities – spaceships and missions. If you want to gain more points, increase the difficulty using sandbox mode settings. You can receive rewards until you reach profile level 7 (for now). New rewards will be added in further updates. [b]Attention![/b] Space points which you've got earlier were recalculated according to the new formula;
[*]Savegames compatibility. Starting from the 1.27 version, you don't need to worry about your savegames. They are compatible with this and all the future versions of Space Rogue.
[*]Sandbox mode presets. If you don't want to deeply research sandbox settings just choose one of the difficulty settings (Easy, Medium, Hard). They are balanced for the best experience of your preference;
[*]Interface improvements. New start game screen, nice artworks, backgrounds, animations and so on. The game looks prettier and smoother now;
[*]Various bug fixes, as always. Please, report us via Steam Community if you meet any bug.[/list]

